marika.ito/img/2013/02/13/4035345/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/13/4035345/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私服ってどうやって決めてる？\n気分？それともある適度決めてる？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/13/4035345/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"完全に気分で！\n地元、レッスンならば楽な格好で\nだいたい着るもの決まってるけど。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/13/4035345/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サッカーと野球\nどっちが好きですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/13/4035345/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どっちもできないんですよ。\nでも左胸の勇気、人はなぜで\nサッカーのスタジアムライブしたから\nどちらかといえばサッカーかな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/13/4035345/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"受験控えてるから\n応援メッセください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/13/4035345/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分を信じて\n頑張ってください！！！！\n辛くなったらまりかブログ読んで\n元気になってね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/13/4035345/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/13/4035345/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チョコ誰にあげるのかな？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/13/4035345/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家族、メンバー、スタッフさん\n友達...とみなさん？♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/13/4035345/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"理想の告白シチュエーションて何？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/13/4035345/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなこだわりはない！\nただ、おっきい声で言えないから\n言うならさりげなく...\nてか直接言えないなあ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんの理想の\n告白シチュエーションは？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかみんな新制服載せてるから\n流れで載せちゃーう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/13/4035345/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/13/4035345/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっかはいちばん\nラブリーなやつです。白リボン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スカート長くてかわいいの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-7867":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも読んでくださってる方、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めて読んでくださった方、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントしてくださった方、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/17/8385123/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶賛テスト勉強中"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/17/8385123/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/17/8385123/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/17/8385123/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほうほう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメント読んでみると..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋といえばサンマ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"の方がたくさんだー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/17/8385123/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えっと、漢字だと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋 刀 魚 ね...メモメモ←ぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も最近お魚よく食べるんよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のお弁当の鮭おいしかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/17/8385123/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"梨も多かった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏にいつもおばあちゃんが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"20世紀梨を贈ってくれるんだ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年も夏はこの梨だった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/17/8385123/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普通の梨より甘酸っぱくておいしい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...あんまり梨の話すると"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりん怒っちゃうからやめよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/17/8385123/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"りんごもすきです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前さゆりんに、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「餌付け」って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポケットから取り出した"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ガムもらいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか「何味ー？」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりん「魅惑のベリー」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか「りんごはどこやねん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/17/8385123/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりんはりんご味より"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いちご味がすきみたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"栗きんとん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"栗を潰して丸めた栗きんとんの方ね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分で作れる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/17/8385123/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どや"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だって、茹でて潰して丸めるだけ←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やればできる子♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、食べ物の話ばっかりだ><"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/17/8385123/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/17/8385123/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"紙で指シャッてやってしまった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"痛い"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/17/8385123/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}}